# Business Requirements

## Business Problem

Sales reports are manually created using multiple Excel files.

The current reporting process presents several challenges:

- Reporting takes several hours each month.
- Sales data is stored in different files.
- There is no centralized dashboard.
- Managers cannot easily compare sales across regions.
- Product profitability is difficult to monitor.
- Executives lack real-time business insights.

## Business Objectives

Develop a Power BI dashboard that allows management to:

- Monitor overall sales performance.
- Track monthly revenue and profit.
- Analyze regional performance.
- Identify top-performing products.
- Monitor customer purchasing behavior.
- Evaluate product profitability.
- Improve reporting efficiency.

## Stakeholders

- Sales Director
- Regional Managers
- Finance Team
- Executive Management

## Success Criteria

- Interactive dashboard
- Automated KPI reporting
- Easy filtering by Region, Category, Segment, and Date
- Executive-friendly visualizations
